    "text": "The placebo effect is a well-documented phenomenon in which patients experience real physiological improvements after receiving an inactive treatment. Studies have shown measurable changes in brain chemistry, including endorphin release, in patients who believe they are receiving medication. This effect complicates clinical trials and is the primary reason double-blind randomised controlled trials are the gold standard in medical research.",
